    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have Resistance to Necrotic and Psychic damage. In addition, when an effect would reduce your Hit Point maximum, you can make a DC 15 Constitution saving throw; on a success, your maximum isn't reduced. Each time you make this saving throw after the first, its DC increases by 5; when you finish a Short or Long Rest, it resets to 15.</p>",
